### =======================================
### NgiNep Booking Service - API Testing
### Port: 8083
### =======================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8083
@tokenUser = paste_token_jwt_role_user_disini
@tokenAdmin = paste_token_jwt_role_admin_disini

### ==========================================
### 👨‍💼 USER ROLE (ROLE_USER)
### ==========================================

### 1. Buat Pesanan Baru (Pemesanan Kamar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hotel_id": 1,
  "room_type_id": 1,
  "check_in": "2025-06-01",
  "check_out": "2025-06-03",
  "number_of_guest": 2,
  "total_price": 1000000,
  "orderer_name": "Budi Santoso",
  "orderer_phone": "081234567890",
  "orderer_email": "budi@gmail.com",
  "is_for_self": true
}

###

### 2. Lihat Semua Pesanan Saya
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/my
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

###

### 3. Lihat Pesanan Aktif Saya (PENDING / CONFIRMED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/my?status=active
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

###

### 4. Lihat Riwayat Pesanan Saya (COMPLETED / CANCELLED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/my?status=history
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

###

### 5. Bayar Pesanan (Upload Bukti Bayar)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/1/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payment_method": "Transfer Bank BCA",
  "payment_proof": "https://imgur.com/contoh-struk-transfer.jpg"
}

### ==========================================
### 🛡️ ADMIN ROLE (ROLE_ADMIN_APP / ROLE_ADMIN_HOTEL)
### ==========================================

### 6. Lihat Semua Pesanan 
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

###

### 7. Lihat Pesanan Berdasarkan Hotel (Untuk Filter Admin Hotel)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/hotel/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

###

### 8. Konfirmasi Pesanan (Update Status jadi CONFIRMED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CONFIRMED"
}

###

### 9. Tolak / Batalkan Pesanan (Update Status jadi CANCELLED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CANCELLED"
}

###

### 10. Selesaikan Pesanan (Update Status jadi COMPLETED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

###

### 11. Hapus Data Pesanan Permanen (Hanya Admin App)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
